<title>UK: World Bank sets $900 million one-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets $900 million one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $900 MLN	COUPON     4.70	MATURITY    18.DEC.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.969    PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
